# Not part of the app codebase — internal planning/reference material, keep out of git
reference/
session_handoff.md
Claude outputs/

# Delivered question-bank source folders — merged into data/question_bank.json
# by scripts/merge-question-bank.js, not tracked themselves (same pattern for
# both the original delivery and the round-E additive delivery).
data/question_bank_output/
data/additional_question_bank/

# Ignore all markdown notes except README.md, the two files CLAUDE.md
# explicitly designates as pushed (CLAUDE.md itself, and PLAN.md), and the
# question-bank licensing record (data/QUESTION_BANK_SOURCES.md), which is
# real app-data provenance, not an internal note.
*.md
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!PLAN.md
!codexreview.md
!data/QUESTION_BANK_SOURCES.md
!supabase/README.md

